          <h1><a href="ensured-continuous-releases-new-web-apps-and-apis-global-transportation.html">Continuous release of apps-transportation solution</a></h1>
        </div>
        <div class="info">
          <span> Written by <a class="author-link" href="author/admin.html">Admin</a> | Aug 30, 2019 4:00:00 AM </span>
        </div>
        <div class="blog-section">
          <span><p><strong>Scope: </strong>Sasken was entrusted with the global rollout of an automated fare collection application. This involved work on a shared cloud based environment to guarantee easy collaboration and better productivity across various teams, while adhering to data privacy and regulatory needs.</p> 
<p><strong>Solution:&nbsp; </strong></p> 
<ul> 
 <li class="fa fa-caret-right"><span>Ensured modernization of automated fare collection application to a cloud-oriented architecture</span></li> 
 <li class="fa fa-caret-right"><span>Automated DevOps pipeline to provide Continuous and Incremental release of APIs and microservices across multiple regions</span></li> 
 <li class="fa fa-caret-right"><span>Provided single click deployment of Infrastructure, services and APIs on AWS</span></li> 
 <li class="fa fa-caret-right"><span>Enabled build and test automation using Team city, Infrastructure automation, and Deployment automation</span></li> 
 <li class="fa fa-caret-right"><span>DevOps KPI dashboard for key stakeholders enabled using ELK stack &amp; Kibana to facilitate continuous monitoring &amp; visibility.</span></li> 
</ul> 
<p><strong>Impact:</strong></p> 
<ul> 
 <li class="fa fa-caret-right"><span>Provisioning of environment and applications deployment under three hours leveraging DevOps enabled continuous delivery</span></li> 
 <li class="fa fa-caret-right"><span>Enabled faster release of new services and APIs for Daily Development builds and on-demand production releases</span></li> 
 <li class="fa fa-caret-right"><span>Enhanced customer experience based on continuous insights</span></li> 
 <li class="fa fa-caret-right"><span>Provided easy diagnosis resolution of production issues</span></li> 
